The user interface follows the layout of KeePass Password Safe 2.x
(GPL-2.0-or-later, https://keepass.info). cljpass contains no KeePass code
and no KeePass artwork; all icons are its own drawings. "KeePass" is a name
of its respective owner and is used only to describe compatibility.

AutoOpen (src/cljpass/autoopen.clj) follows the behavior of the KeePass
plugin KeeAutoExec by Dominik Reichl (GPL-2.0-or-later,
https://keepass.info/plugins.html#keeautoexec) and of KeePassXC, so that the
same AutoOpen group works in all of them. It is a reimplementation in
Clojure; no C# code was copied.
